- **의의**: Holoscopic boundary 영역에서 관찰되는 특징적인 간섭 패턴

### Video 2 — Circular Interference
[![Video 2](https://img.shields.io/badge/Video_2-Circular_Interference-blue)](https://github.com/Chur-chin/serpentine-optical-interferometer/blob/main/media/holoscopic-boundary/videos/circular_interference.mp4)

